{"seq":9,"slug":"atmospheric-science","title":"大气科学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"大气科学\">大气科学</h1><p>我决定自学大气科学，是因为某个夏天午后突如其来的雷暴：上午还是大太阳，下午却电闪雷鸣、半小时内降下几十毫米雨水。我很好奇，天上那层看不见摸不着的空气，究竟遵循着什么样的规则，能在几个小时里翻脸。这个学科给了我答案——它把&quot;天气&quot;从一种生活体验，变成了一套可以用物理和数学描述、甚至可以预测的系统。</p>\n<p>大气科学研究的是包裹地球的那层气体：它由什么构成，如何吸收和释放热量，怎样流动，又如何形成我们每天经历的晴雨冷暖，以及在更长的时间尺度上塑造出区域气候与全球气候。它既是一门基础物理科学，也是一门和每个人生活、农业、航空、能源、防灾都息息相关的应用科学。</p>\n<p>我把整个自学路径拆成了四个循序渐进的部分。</p>\n<p>第一部分是大气的&quot;物质与能量基础&quot;：大气有哪些成分、分成哪些层、温度随高度如何变化，以及空气作为一种气体如何遵循热力学规律膨胀、冷却、凝结成云。这是后面一切的地基。</p>\n<p>第二部分进入&quot;运动与动力学&quot;：空气为什么会流动，气压梯度力、科里奥利力、摩擦力如何共同决定风向风速，大尺度环流和各种大气波动又是如何组织起来的。这部分数学味道浓一些，但每个公式背后都有清晰的物理图像。</p>\n<p>第三部分讲&quot;天气系统与预报&quot;：气团、锋面、温带气旋这些天气图上的主角是怎么回事，以及现代数值天气预报——包括 2025 至 2026 年迅速崛起的 AI 预报模型——是如何把物理定律变成你手机上那条降水概率的。</p>\n<p>第四部分聚焦&quot;气候与气候变化&quot;：气候系统由哪些部分耦合而成，以及在二氧化碳浓度于 2025 年突破 430 ppm 的当下，全球变暖意味着什么、未来情景又有哪些。</p>\n<p>这套材料假设你具备高中物理和基础微积分的直觉即可，不需要专业气象学背景。我尽量用生活中能观察到的现象做切入，把抽象公式还原成可感知的过程。读完之后，你再抬头看天，看到的将不只是云，而是一套正在运转的物理系统。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics","title":"大气组成与热力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atmosphere-structure-composition","title":"大气的成分与垂直结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/atmosphere-structure-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"atmospheric-thermodynamics","title":"大气热力学与绝热过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/atmospheric-thermodynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"water-vapor-and-clouds","title":"水汽、饱和与云的形成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/water-vapor-and-clouds"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"atmospheric-motion-dynamics","title":"大气运动与动力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forces-on-air-parcels","title":"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/forces-on-air-parcels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wind-and-circulation","title":"全球大气环流与风系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/wind-and-circulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"atmospheric-waves-instability","title":"大气波动与不稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/atmospheric-waves-instability"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"weather-systems-forecasting","title":"天气系统与预报","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/weather-systems-forecasting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"air-masses-and-fronts","title":"气团与锋面","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/weather-systems-forecasting/air-masses-and-fronts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mid-latitude-cyclones","title":"温带气旋的生命史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/weather-systems-forecasting/mid-latitude-cyclones"},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-weather-prediction","title":"数值天气预报与 AI 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/weather-systems-forecasting/numerical-weather-prediction"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"climate-and-climate-change","title":"气候与气候变化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/climate-and-climate-change","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-system-basics","title":"气候系统与能量平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/climate-and-climate-change/climate-system-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-warming-and-projections","title":"全球变暖的机制与未来情景","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/climate-and-climate-change/global-warming-and-projections"}]}]}